4af8","author":"unknown","text":"Ran scripts/test.py after new coverage harness additions; tests pass but coverage still 97% with same missing lines (dotyaml, markov, topic_modeling, cli, corpus, extraction, stt, benchmark_runner, user_config, workflow, neo4j, amplify_publisher). Continuing targeted coverage work.","created_at":"2026-02-17T02:56:31.797574Z"},{"id":"47a516c1-133b-453e-a72e-f4c3756c5996","author":"unknown","text":"Planning next coverage push: confirm current coverage + remaining gaps, then add BDD scenarios/steps to hit missing lines (cli/corpus/extraction/markov/topic_modeling/STT/benchmark_runner/dotyaml). Will run behave + pytest + coverage, then ruff/black, then gh CI. Next: run coverage report with precision and identify why gap not moving.","created_at":"2026-02-17T02:58:26.186788Z"},{"id":"dfeb68c7-6772-4863-a4ee-8bab71230f41","author":"unknown","text":"Resuming coverage push. Plan: add new BDD scenarios and extend coverage harness steps to hit remaining uncovered modules (analysis/models, profiling, topic_modeling, extraction, corpus/cli, extractors, retrieval, migration, hooks, graph/neo4j, chunking). Will iterate run behave/pytest/coverage in py311 and log results with precision; no pytest-only tests; keep changes in features/*.feature + step defs.","created_at":"2026-02-17T03:30:35.220459Z"},{"id":"cf5d9f67-3777-4342-a177-6180796d53a3","author":"unknown","text":"Ran behave -n 'Exhaust coverage gaps' (pass). Ran conda run -n py311 python scripts/test.py (coverage fail-under=100; total 90%). Coverage report shows largest remaining gaps: cli.py (142 lines), profiling.py (93), topic_modeling.py (77), extraction_evaluation.py (66), crawl.py (63), ocr_benchmark.py (57), corpus.py (54), evaluation/retrieval.py (51), neo4j.py (40), multiple extractors (docling*, openai_stt, rapidocr, etc.). Added more coverage harness logic and helper _write_minimal_extraction_snapshot; next steps: extend harness to exercise profiling/topic_modeling/extraction_evaluation/crawl, and mock optional extractor dependencies to cover remaining modules.","created_at":"2026-02-17T03:54:35.273777Z"},{"id":"50aa131f-b1dd-4a8d-a20d-6c965917be1d","author":"unknown","text":"Continuing coverage push per plan. Read CONTRIBUTING_AGENT.md. Next: re-run behave coverage scenario and coverage report to locate remaining gaps, then extend BDD scenarios/steps in features/coverage_harness.feature + features/steps/coverage_harness_steps.py to cover cli/corpus/extraction/analysis/extractors/graph/crawl/evaluation gaps. Will log each batch.","created_at":"2026-02-17T03:55:30.968225Z"},{"id":"0e007610-c08e-47a2-86cb-66d547fd02ed","author":"unknown","text":"Starting execution of plan: BDD-only coverage to 100%. Read CONTRIBUTING_AGENT.md; will add Gherkin scenarios + steps to cover remaining gaps (cli/corpus/extraction/analysis/topic modeling/STT). Next: inspect current coverage report, add scenarios, run behave/pytest/coverage, then lint and GH CI.","created_at":"2026-02-17T04:25:56.564873Z"},{"id":"bc0630cc-71ac-40f1-b0f4-7549b9d3f242","author":"unknown","text":"Ran: conda run -n py311 python scripts/test.py. Coverage 94% (TOTAL 12613, missing 676, fail-under=100). Report at reports/htmlcov/index.html. Notable misses: analysis/profiling.py (many), cli.py (large), corpus.py (37), extraction.py (24), analysis/markov.py, analysis/topic_modeling.py, evaluation/ocr_benchmark.py, graph/extraction.py, graph/neo4j.py, retrievers/sqlite_full_text_search.py, tf_vector.py, sources.py, several extractors (docling_*, faster_whisper_stt.py, openai_*_stt.py, paddleocr_vl_text.py, select_* overrides), ignore.py, workflow.py. Next: target BDD scenarios and steps to cover these edges per plan.","created_at":"2026-02-17T04:27:41.507282Z"},{"id":"e3855b71-d0d9-4a09-9a10-781cb9f31f69","author":"unknown","text":"Ran: conda run -n py311 python scripts/test.py. Coverage now 95% (TOTAL 12613, missing 506). Notable remaining misses: cli.py still 139 lines; corpus.py 37 lines; ex